    <h1 class="text-[28px] leading-tight font-semibold">404</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">
      This page scored 0.0000 because it does not exist. Check the address, or <a href="/" class="text-blue-700 underline underline-offset-2">head back to the homepage</a>.
